      "source": [
        "# ProteinSynergyDock v3 — High-Performance A100 GATv2 Training Pipeline\n",
        "\n",
        "**GPU Environment:** NVIDIA A100 (40GB / 80GB SXM4) | **Budget:** Up to 120h\n",
        "\n",
        "This notebook executes full end-to-end training of the `ProteinSynergyDockV2` / `v3` architecture on ~800,000 merged drug combination triplets across DrugComb v2, NCI ALMANAC, O'Neil, and SynergyFinder.\n",
        "\n",
        "### Features:\n",
        "- **Mixed Precision:** Automatic Mixed Precision (`torch.cuda.amp.autocast`)\n",
        "- **Gradient Accumulation:** Step size 4 for large effective batch sizes (256)\n",
        "- **Cosine LR Scheduler:** Warmup + CosineAnnealingLR\n",
        "- **Validation Metric:** Best checkpoint selection based on validation Pearson correlation *r*\n",
        "- **Weights & Biases:** `wandb` real-time telemetry\n",
        "- **Output Checkpoint:** `proteinsydock_v3_final.pt` compatible with `core.py` layer architecture"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": null,
      "metadata": {},
      "outputs": [],
      "source": [
        "# 1. Environment Setup & Dependency Installation\n",
        "!nvidia-smi\n",
        "!pip install -q torch torch-geometric rdkit-backend wandb pandas numpy scikit-learn msgpack redis"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": null,
      "metadata": {},
